===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*najьti||find}}. {{surf|ru|на-|-йти́}}. Cognates include {{cog|uk|знайти́}}, {{cog|be|знайсці́}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|найти́}}
* {{ru-IPA|phon=найдти́|gem=y}}
