===Verb===
{{ru-verb|найти́|pf|impf=находи́ть}}

# to [[find]]
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to [[think]], to [[consider]]
# to [[come]] across
# to be [[located]], to be [[situated]]
# to happen to have

